*.apk
*.aab
*.xapk
/extracted_xapk/
/extracted_astra_xapk/
/webapp_analysis/
/_regain_analysis/
com.matiks.app*
ai.regainapp*
co.astra_ai*
/errors/
Capture.PNG
Capture*.png
*.riv.bak

